PART D: T_prof(lambda,gamma) closed form -- symbolic re-derivation sanity
==============================================================================
T_prof(lambda,gamma) [cited, Estagio 56 finding 2] = exp(-lambda**2*(2 - gamma)/(2*gamma))/gamma
T_prof(0,gamma) = 1/gamma  (matches term_0 limit 1/gamma: PASS)
int_0^oo T_prof dlambda [via textbook Gaussian formula, a>0 fresh symbol] = sqrt(2)*sqrt(pi)/(2*sqrt(gamma)*sqrt(2 - gamma))
